PTX rs-mainloop-war+ldmatrix
"RS mainloop: the consumer reads operand A from the stage with ldmatrix (generic proxy) and releases the stage with a plain mbarrier arrive, with no fence.proxy.async in between (CUTLASS sm90_mma_tma_gmma_rs_warpspecialized.hpp:666-684); the producer then refills the stage with an async-proxy copy. The ldmatrix must not see the refill. Expected: forbidden (NVIDIA relies on it without a proxy fence)."
{
g=7;
d=5 @cta 0;
c=0 @cta 0;
e=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
f=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                  | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 mbarrier.try_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, e, 0                             | ldmatrix.sync.aligned.m8n8.x1.shared.b16 r1, d ;
 mbarrier.arrive.expect_tx.release.cta f, 1                                | mbarrier.arrive.release.cta e                  ;
 cp.async.bulk.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, f |                                                ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 7)
